          "id": "2125809786264625233",
          "text": "Just complete BS. The Police Protective League spent $0 against Pratt. \n\nThey wanted a Pratt runoff so badly they spent $200k trying to boost Rae Huang in an effort to squeeze Nithya Raman out of the runoff.",
